---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="About - BALD SOFTWARE GUY" description="Learn more about the most epic bald software developer" />
		<style>
			@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@400;700;900&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap');
			
			:root {
				--neon-blue: #00ffff;
				--neon-pink: #ff00ff;
				--neon-green: #00ff00;
				--dark-bg: #0a0a0a;
				--matrix-green: #00ff41;
				--cyber-purple: #8a2be2;
			}

			body {
				background: var(--dark-bg);
				color: white;
				font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
				margin: 0;
				overflow-x: hidden;
			}

			.about-hero {
				min-height: 60vh;
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a0a0a, #1a1a1a, #0a0a0a);
				position: relative;
				overflow: hidden;
			}

			.about-hero::before {
				content: '';
				position: absolute;
				top: 0;
				left: 0;
				right: 0;
				bottom: 0;
				background: url('data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100"><defs><pattern id="grid" width="10" height="10" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M 10 0 L 0 0 0 10" fill="none" stroke="%2300ffff" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.3"/></pattern></defs><rect width="100" height="100" fill="url(%23grid)"/></svg>');
				animation: gridMove 20s linear infinite;
			}

			.hero-content {
				text-align: center;
				z-index: 10;
				position: relative;
			}

			.hero-title {
				font-family: 'Orbitron', monospace;
				font-size: 3.5rem;
				font-weight: 900;
				background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--neon-blue), var(--neon-pink), var(--neon-green));
				background-size: 200% 200%;
				-webkit-background-clip: text;
				-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
				background-clip: text;
				animation: neonGlow 3s ease-in-out infinite;
				text-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--neon-blue);
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
			}

			.hero-subtitle {
				font-size: 1.3rem;
				color: var(--matrix-green);
				animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
			}

			main {
				max-width: 1200px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 4rem 2rem;
			}

			.section {
				margin-bottom: 4rem;
				background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.05);
				border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);
				border-radius: 15px;
				padding: 2rem;
				position: relative;
				overflow: hidden;
			}

			.section::before {
				content: '';
				position: absolute;
				top: 0;
				left: -100%;
				width: 100%;
				height: 100%;
				background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1), transparent);
				transition: left 0.5s ease;
			}

			.section:hover::before {
				left: 100%;
			}

			.section h2 {
				font-family: 'Orbitron', monospace;
				font-size: 2.5rem;
				color: var(--neon-blue);
				margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
				text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-blue);
			}

			.section p {
				font-size: 1.1rem;
				line-height: 1.8;
				margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
				color: #e0e0e0;
			}

			.skills-grid {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
				gap: 2rem;
				margin-top: 2rem;
			}

			.skill-card {
				background: rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.1);
				border: 2px solid var(--neon-pink);
				border-radius: 10px;
				padding: 1.5rem;
				text-align: center;
				transition: all 0.3s ease;
				position: relative;
				overflow: hidden;
			}

			.skill-card::before {
				content: '';
				position: absolute;
				top: 0;
				left: 0;
				right: 0;
				bottom: 0;
				background: linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.1), transparent);
				transform: translateX(-100%);
				transition: transform 0.3s ease;
			}

			.skill-card:hover {
				transform: translateY(-5px);
				box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.3);
			}

			.skill-card:hover::before {
				transform: translateX(100%);
			}

			.skill-card h3 {
				color: var(--neon-pink);
				font-family: 'Orbitron', monospace;
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
				font-size: 1.3rem;
			}

			.skill-card p {
				color: #ccc;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
			}

			.timeline {
				position: relative;
				margin-top: 3rem;
			}

			.timeline::before {
				content: '';
				position: absolute;
				left: 50%;
				top: 0;
				bottom: 0;
				width: 2px;
				background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--neon-blue), var(--neon-pink));
				transform: translateX(-50%);
			}

			.timeline-item {
				position: relative;
				margin-bottom: 3rem;
				width: 45%;
			}

			.timeline-item:nth-child(odd) {
				left: 0;
			}

			.timeline-item:nth-child(even) {
				left: 55%;
			}

			.timeline-content {
				background: rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.1);
				border: 2px solid var(--neon-green);
				border-radius: 10px;
				padding: 1.5rem;
				position: relative;
			}

			.timeline-content::before {
				content: '';
				position: absolute;
				top: 50%;
				width: 20px;
				height: 20px;
				background: var(--neon-green);
				border-radius: 50%;
				transform: translateY(-50%);
			}

			.timeline-item:nth-child(odd) .timeline-content::before {
				right: -60px;
			}

			.timeline-item:nth-child(even) .timeline-content::before {
				left: -60px;
			}

			.timeline-content h3 {
				color: var(--neon-green);
				font-family: 'Orbitron', monospace;
				margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
			}

			.timeline-content .date {
				color: #888;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
			}

			@keyframes neonGlow {
				0%, 100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
				50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
			}

			@keyframes pulse {
				0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
				50% { opacity: 0.7; }
			}

			@keyframes gridMove {
				0% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
				100% { transform: translate(10px, 10px); }
			}

			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				.hero-title {
					font-size: 2.5rem;
				}
				
				.hero-subtitle {
					font-size: 1.1rem;
				}
				
				.section h2 {
					font-size: 2rem;
				}
				
				.timeline::before {
					left: 20px;
				}
				
				.timeline-item {
					width: 100%;
					left: 0 !important;
					margin-left: 50px;
				}
				
				.timeline-content::before {
					left: -50px !important;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		
		<section class="about-hero">
			<div class="hero-content">
				<h1 class="hero-title">ABOUT THE BALD LEGEND</h1>
				<p class="hero-subtitle">Discover the story behind the most epic bald software developer</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<main>
			<section class="section">
				<h2>🚀 WHO AM I?</h2>
				<p>
					I'm not just another developer - I'm THE Bald Software Guy. Born with a passion for code and a head that's smoother than my deployment pipeline, I've been crafting digital experiences that are as clean as my scalp.
				</p>
				<p>
					When I'm not debugging the universe or writing code that makes other developers weep tears of joy, you'll find me exploring the latest technologies, contributing to open source projects, and occasionally explaining to people that yes, I do have a personality despite my lack of hair.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="section">
				<h2>⚡ MY SUPERPOWERS</h2>
				<div class="skills-grid">
					<div class="skill-card">
						<h3>🔧 Full-Stack Mastery</h3>
						<p>From frontend to backend, I make it all work seamlessly. React, Node.js, Python - you name it, I've probably built something awesome with it.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="skill-card">
						<h3>🐛 Bug Hunter Extraordinaire</h3>
						<p>I find bugs faster than you can say "it works on my machine." My debugging skills are legendary in the developer community.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="skill-card">
						<h3>🚀 Performance Optimizer</h3>
						<p>I make applications run faster than my hair grows back. Every millisecond counts, and I squeeze performance out of every line of code.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="skill-card">
						<h3>🎨 UI/UX Enthusiast</h3>
						<p>Creating interfaces that are as smooth and intuitive as my head. User experience is everything, and I make sure every interaction feels natural.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="skill-card">
						<h3>☁️ Cloud Architect</h3>
						<p>Building scalable solutions in the cloud that are as reliable as my commitment to staying bald. AWS, Azure, GCP - I've got you covered.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="skill-card">
						<h3>🤝 Team Player</h3>
						<p>Collaborating with teams to create amazing products. I bring the same energy to code reviews as I do to explaining why I'm bald by choice.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="section">
				<h2>📈 MY JOURNEY</h2>
				<div class="timeline">
					<div class="timeline-item">
						<div class="timeline-content">
							<h3>🎓 The Beginning</h3>
							<div class="date">2015 - 2018</div>
							<p>Started my journey in computer science, learning the fundamentals while my hair was still trying to decide if it wanted to stay or go.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="timeline-item">
						<div class="timeline-content">
							<h3>💼 First Developer Role</h3>
							<div class="date">2018 - 2020</div>
							<p>Landed my first job as a junior developer. This is when I realized that being bald actually made me look more professional and intimidating in code reviews.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="timeline-item">
						<div class="timeline-content">
							<h3>🚀 Senior Developer</h3>
							<div class="date">2020 - 2022</div>
							<p>Promoted to senior developer. My baldness was now a symbol of experience and wisdom in the tech world.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="timeline-item">
						<div class="timeline-content">
							<h3>🌟 Bald Software Guy</h3>
							<div class="date">2022 - Present</div>
							<p>Fully embraced my identity as the Bald Software Guy. Now I'm not just a developer - I'm a legend in the making.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="section">
				<h2>🎯 MY PHILOSOPHY</h2>
				<p>
					<strong>"Code is like humor. When you have to explain it, it's bad."</strong> - This is my mantra. I believe in writing code that's so clean and well-documented that even a junior developer with a full head of hair can understand it.
				</p>
				<p>
					I'm passionate about creating software that not only works flawlessly but also brings joy to the people who use it. Whether it's a simple utility or a complex enterprise application, I approach every project with the same level of enthusiasm and attention to detail.
				</p>
				<p>
					And yes, I'm bald by choice. It's aerodynamic, it's professional, and most importantly, it's me. Just like my code, I keep it clean, simple, and efficient.
				</p>
			</section>
		</main>

		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
